    <p>
      <b>Description</b>
    </p>
    <p>Generates an impulse (approximate Dirac) at a given time with specified amplitude.</p>
    <p>
      <b>Ports</b>
    </p>
    <p>
      <b>Input(s)</b>
    </p>
    <p>This block declares no input ports.</p>
    <p>
      <b>Output(s)</b>
    </p>
    <table border="1">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Port</th>
          <th>Role</th>
          <th>Side</th>
          <th>Position</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>Port_1</td>
          <td>Numeric signal produced by the block.</td>
          <td>right</td>
          <td>x=80, y=40</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p>
      <b>Parameters</b>
    </p>
    <table border="1">
