    <p>
      <b>Algorithms</b>
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>OUTPUT block with no inputs.</li>
      <li>The output is amp when abs(t - time) &lt;= dt / 2, otherwise 0.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      <b>Equation or Rule</b>
    </p>
    <latex>y = \begin{cases} amp, &amp; t \approx time \\ 0, &amp; \mathrm{otherwise} \end{cases}</latex>
